[
  {
    "id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-4a5b-8c9d-0e1f2a3b4c5d",
    "text": "A ship in the harbor is safe, but that is not what ships are built for.",
    "category": "Possibility",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "imageCard",
    "imageCardURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/A%20ship%20in%20the%20harbor%20is%20safe%2C%20but%20that%20is%20not%20what%20ships%20are%20built%20for..png",
    "sortOrder": 1
  },
  {
    "id": "b2c3d4e5-f6a7-4b5c-9d0e-1f2a3b4c5d6e",
    "text": "You'll never feel ready. Do it anyway.",
    "category": "Agency",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "imageCard",
    "imageCardURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/doitanyway.png",
    "sortOrder": 2
  },
  {
    "id": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-4c5d-0e1f-2a3b4c5d6e7f",
    "text": "Is this the life you really want?",
    "category": "Rebuilding",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "imageCard",
    "imageCardURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/thelifeyouwant.png",
    "sortOrder": 3
  },
  {
    "id": "d4e5f6a7-b8c9-4d5e-1f2a-3b4c5d6e7f8a",
    "text": "You are not who you were yesterday. Possibility lives in that space.",
    "category": "Possibility",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "textOverlay",
    "backgroundImageURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-1",
    "sortOrder": 4
  },
  {
    "id": "e5f6a7b8-c9d0-4e5f-2a3b-4c5d6e7f8a9b",
    "text": "You'll probably fail at this too. Why even try?",
    "category": "Demotivation",
    "trackType": "demotivation",
    "presentationMode": "textOverlay",
    "imageCardURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-2",
    "sortOrder": 5
  },
  {
    "id": "f6a7b8c9-d0e1-4f5a-3b4c-5d6e7f8a9b0c",
    "text": "The wound is where the light enters you.",
    "category": "Rebuilding",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "textOverlay",
    "backgroundImageURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-3",
    "sortOrder": 6
  },
  {
    "id": "a7b8c9d0-e1f2-4a5b-4c5d-6e7f8a9b0c1d",
    "text": "Rock bottom became the solid foundation on which I rebuilt my life.",
    "category": "Rebuilding",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "imageCard",
    "imageCardURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-1",
    "sortOrder": 7
  },
  {
    "id": "b8c9d0e1-f2a3-4b5c-5d6e-7f8a9b0c1d2e",
    "text": "You don't have to see the whole staircase. Just take the first step.",
    "category": "Agency",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "textOverlay",
    "backgroundImageURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-2",
    "sortOrder": 8
  },
  {
    "id": "c9d0e1f2-a3b4-4c5d-6e7f-8a9b0c1d2e3f",
    "text": "What if everything you're going through is preparing you for what you asked for?",
    "category": "Possibility",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "textOverlay",
    "imageCardURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-3",
    "sortOrder": 9
  },
  {
    "id": "d0e1f2a3-b4c5-4d5e-7f8a-9b0c1d2e3f4a",
    "text": "The comeback is always stronger than the setback.",
    "category": "Rebuilding",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "textOverlay",
    "backgroundImageURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-1",
    "sortOrder": 10
  },
  {
    "id": "e1f2a3b4-c5d6-4e5f-8a9b-0c1d2e3f4a5b",
    "text": "Your life isn't yours. It belongs to everyone who's disappointed in you.",
    "category": "Demotivation",
    "trackType": "demotivation",
    "presentationMode": "textOverlay",
    "imageCardURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-2",
    "sortOrder": 11
  },
  {
    "id": "f2a3b4c5-d6e7-4f5a-9b0c-1d2e3f4a5b6c",
    "text": "Every master was once a disaster.",
    "category": "Possibility",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "textOverlay",
    "backgroundImageURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-3",
    "sortOrder": 12
  },
  {
    "id": "a3b4c5d6-e7f8-4a5b-0c1d-2e3f4a5b6c7d",
    "text": "You're allowed to scream. You're allowed to cry. But do not give up.",
    "category": "Agency",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "textOverlay",
    "imageCardURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-1",
    "sortOrder": 13
  },
  {
    "id": "b4c5d6e7-f8a9-4b5c-1d2e-3f4a5b6c7d8e",
    "text": "Sometimes the bravest thing you can do is keep going.",
    "category": "Agency",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "textOverlay",
    "backgroundImageURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-2",
    "sortOrder": 14
  },
  {
    "id": "c5d6e7f8-a9b0-4c5d-2e3f-4a5b6c7d8e9f",
    "text": "What looks like failure now might be the foundation of your greatest success.",
    "category": "Rebuilding",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "imageCard",
    "imageCardURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-3",
    "sortOrder": 15
  },
  {
    "id": "d6e7f8a9-b0c1-4d5e-3f4a-5b6c7d8e9f0a",
    "text": "You can't start the next chapter if you keep re-reading the last one.",
    "category": "Possibility",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "textOverlay",
    "backgroundImageURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-1",
    "sortOrder": 16
  },
  {
    "id": "e7f8a9b0-c1d2-4e5f-4a5b-6c7d8e9f0a1b",
    "text": "Nothing you do will ever be enough. Just accept that.",
    "category": "Demotivation",
    "trackType": "demotivation",
    "presentationMode": "imageCard",
    "imageCardURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-2",
    "sortOrder": 17
  },
  {
    "id": "f8a9b0c1-d2e3-4f5a-5b6c-7d8e9f0a1b2c",
    "text": "Your current situation is not your final destination.",
    "category": "Possibility",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "textOverlay",
    "backgroundImageURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-3",
    "sortOrder": 18
  },
  {
    "id": "a9b0c1d2-e3f4-4a5b-6c7d-8e9f0a1b2c3d",
    "text": "Growth is uncomfortable because you've never been here before.",
    "category": "Agency",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "imageCard",
    "imageCardURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-1",
    "sortOrder": 19
  },
  {
    "id": "b0c1d2e3-f4a5-4b5c-7d8e-9f0a1b2c3d4e",
    "text": "The only impossible journey is the one you never begin.",
    "category": "Agency",
    "trackType": "hope",
    "presentationMode": "textOverlay",
    "backgroundImageURL": "https://pub-0017d537075f47dba685fa2a8ebf5591.r2.dev/image-2",
    "sortOrder": 20
  }
]
